irl playing some toy instruments. \nI'd like to use this as cover art (and a looping youtube video) for music that I make!\nI like to post the song to music streaming services and SNS\nThe theme is imagination and music!\n\nI imagine the little girl sitting on the ground playing with children's instruments (like a tiny piano, xylophone, marimba, and little drum for example).\n\nThe little girl can be very mundane, so as to appeal to many people please. \n\nI like a very cute and charming look. The music itself is very playful and for a similar sound, it is like \"Christmas of a Wandering Ghost\" by (Snail's House).\n\nMaybe their can be little music notes bouncing around? Maybe she just blinks? Anything to give a little fun movement to the illustration please.\n\nIf nothing else, please capture the feeling of being a child playing with music! Lots of imagination, and dreams, and happiness!\n\nThe song itself is called \"Make Believe\"", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "video", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@Cinerea/works/9", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "video", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3809696, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/66ac4d08/uploads/outputs/c117c8f0-3604-48b3-ae1a-20b8812b0c16?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=48db64d69651d17d8e838c87f45c9870", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/66ac4d08/uploads/outputs/c117c8f0-3604-48b3-ae1a-20b8812b0c16?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=48db64d69651d17d8e838c87f45c9870, https://si.imgix.net/66ac4d08/uploads/outputs/c117c8f0-3604-48b3-ae1a-20b8812b0c16?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=af3846bb3b7f2b6372f4d1258cea5890 2x, https://si.imgix.net/66ac4d08/uploads/outputs/c117c8f0-3604-48b3-ae1a-20b8812b0c16?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3120f86ec5a535cc79a3c220fba7310d 3x"}, "durati